# 07: MadGraph's scan syntax: one launch, several coefficient values; the interference (NP^2==2)
# scales linearly, the squared term (04) quadratically.
# The numbers this prints are illustrative, not precision results.  At 2000 events an
# interference sample's effective statistics is the excess of positive over negative
# events, so MadGraph's quoted error is optimistic.  Running several points in sequence
# through one process directory also reuses the integration grid of the previous point.
# Use examples/studies/run_study.sh for numbers you intend to quote.
import model dim8_is
generate p p > w+ w- NP^2==2
output runs/07_ww_scan
launch runs/07_ww_scan
set nevents 2000
set hel_recycling False
set ebeam1 6800
set ebeam2 6800
set lam__2 1000
set c8q2W2Dx1 scan:[-2.0, -1.0, 1.0, 2.0]
done
